{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_two_notebook_modes", "label": "Two notebook modes chosen at creation, switchable any time with client re-encryption: private and \u00abfor agents\u00bb (D-04, D-09)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_private_mode", "label": "Private notebooks (like Notesnook): key from user password, only on user devices; server stores ciphertext and relays encrypted changes; agents have no access", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_agent_mode", "label": "\u00abFor agents\u00bb notebooks: notebook key in server's protected key store; decryption only on request with valid token and rights for that notebook", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_honest_warning", "label": "UI honestly warns that in agent mode the server can technically read notes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_libsodium_all_platforms", "label": "libsodium on all platforms (swift-sodium on iOS, libsodium-wrappers in TS) \u2014 \u041f\u0420\u0415\u0414\u041b\u041e\u0416\u0415\u041d\u041e, details stage 3", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_argon2id_kdf", "label": "Argon2id \u2014 key derivation from password", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_xchacha20_poly1305", "label": "XChaCha20-Poly1305 \u2014 content encryption", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_per_notebook_key", "label": "Separate key per notebook, wrapped by user master key (private) or server key (agent mode)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_server_key_separate", "label": "Server key for agent mode stored separately from DB (env secret/file), so a DB dump alone cannot decrypt (R-10)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_shared_test_vectors", "label": "Swift \u2194 TypeScript compatibility checked by shared test vectors (packages/test-vectors)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_login_recovery", "label": "Login = email + password; login key and encryption key derived on device; recovery key issued at signup (R-02); exact formats in contracts/crypto.md (D-34)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_recovery_key_optional_check", "label": "Optional recovery-key check (\u00ab\u041f\u0440\u043e\u043f\u0443\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0442\u044c\u00bb with warning); key re-shown only on issuing device; \u00ab\u0421\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0439 \u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447 \u0432\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f\u00bb by password on any device (POST /v1/auth/recovery-key); reminder until settings.recoveryKeyConfirmed; security log (\u0420\u0415\u0428\u0415\u041d\u041e 2026-10-25)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_revoked_device_wipe", "label": "Session revoked from another device (server unambiguous; not network error/expired token) \u2192 client wipes all local data (DB, keys, attachments, image cache, unsent changes) and shows message; warning on the revoking device (D-53, replaces 2026-10-26 rule); login screen still has \u00ab\u0423\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430\u00bb", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_logout_keep_unsent_keys", "label": "Logout (\u0420\u0415\u0428\u0415\u041d\u041e 2026-10-26): warning \u00ab\u041d\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435 N \u043d\u0435\u043e\u0442\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0438\u0437\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439\u2026\u00bb with \u00ab\u0421\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043b\u0430 \u043e\u0442\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044c\u00bb/\u00ab\u0412\u044b\u0439\u0442\u0438\u00bb; keys of unsent notebooks kept until sent after re-login to same account; deleted on other-account login or \u00ab\u0423\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430\u00bb", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_local_mcp_bridge", "label": "Future: local MCP bridge \u2014 utility on user's computer holding the key, giving local agents access even to private notebooks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_encryption_diagram", "label": "Diagram: clients (iPad, iPhone, web) hold keys; server with private notebooks (E2E), agent notebooks (key store, token-only decryption), API & MCP (tokens, rights, audit log); external agents (Claude, ChatGPT)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_ios_device_protection", "label": "iOS device data protection (audit 2026-10-27, build 21)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_ios_names_not_paths", "label": "Names from note content are not paths: attachment ids only UUIDv7 (EntityID.isValid); file block name only last component without / \\ or dot-only names", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_ios_wipe_decrypted_attachments", "label": "\u00ab\u0423\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430\u00bb and other-account login wipe decrypted attachments (files + records) and in-memory images; session closed on server first (/auth/logout)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_ios_clipboard_secrets", "label": "Secrets in clipboard (recovery key, agent token, #k= link) local-only (no Universal Clipboard), disappear after 60 s", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_ios_recovery_key_biometric", "label": "Re-showing recovery key requires Face ID / Touch ID / passcode; hidden while screen is recorded or mirrored", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_ios_large_image_decode", "label": "Large images decoded off main thread and never fully (ImageIO downsampling from file); >50 Mp rejected before decoding", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_07_encryption_ios_pasted_web_images", "label": "Images from pasted web page downloaded by separate session without cookies/cache: https only, \u226420 MB, 15 s, \u22643 redirects, \u226450 images per paste; loopback/private/link-local/.local blocked after DNS and on each redirect", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/07-encryption.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_spec_07_encryption_two_notebook_modes", "